WEBVTT

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:05.940
Mamoru Takamura is the hero of Japan and a world-class contender.

00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:09.980
I must put everything on the mat when I fight him.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:10.940
I repeat:

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:14.200
I will do my very best. That's all.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:17.530
Did you hear that, Takamura?

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:20.160
That's the most puerile crap I've ever heard.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:23.240
Let's have a good match.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.310
Put that hand away.

00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:31.300
Your hokeyness might rub off on me.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.700
Won't you shake his hand?

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:38.460
Shut up! We're leaving!

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:39.810
What's his deal?

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:42.180
He could at least take his hands out of his pockets.

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:45.600
That's no way to treat the champion who came all the way from America.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:48.340
He's exactly how I pictured him.

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:49.860
What a rude Japanese.

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:51.860
I don't think so.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:55.490
I can tell from his eyes that he's in fighting mode.

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:57.870
There's no way he'd shake my hand.

00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:02.280
The hands inside his pockets are probably bunched up into tight fists,

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:03.870
ready to hit me.

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:07.270
<i>Now that's what I'm talking about.</i>

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:30.020
Looks like there won't be any delays or anything.

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:31.920
And we've got a live crowd tonight.

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:35.090
Stop being so nervous!

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:36.950
It's starting to affect me!

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:37.340
What?

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:39.530
You're the one making me nervous!

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:40.510
Huh?

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:50.180
We shouldn't waste our punches on each other.

00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:52.650
Yeah, we should focus on our matches.

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:10.960
Aoki-san! Kimura-san!

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:12.630
How're you feeling?!

00:02:14.670 --> 00:02:16.420
Don't scare us like that!

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:19.130
We're trying to focus here! Don't come in!

00:02:19.850 --> 00:02:22.390
Don't tell me that you're nervous?

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:27.680
S-Sorry to bother you! Good luck with your fights!

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:29.270
Don't do that, Manabu-kun.

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:31.440
H-Hold on, Ippo!

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:36.780
You've fought in a world title semifinal match before, haven't you?

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:38.990
Yes, I have.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:42.950
We've never fought in a huge arena before.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:44.870
How did it go for you?

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:47.090
Did your balls shrink back or anything?

00:02:47.090 --> 00:02:51.040
I was pretty nervous. But I had no choice but to fight.

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:56.340
Even in a bigger arena, once I entered the ring, 
all I could really see were my immediate surroundings.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:00.330
It was the same with me as it's always been.

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:01.800
Whatever happens, happens.

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:03.850
<i>He just shrugs it off?</i>

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:05.800
<i>He's become a real big shot.</i>

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:09.320
I want to have fun with any crowd I face.

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:13.480
A bigger arena means more spectators.

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:14.890
Even if I don't get the top billing,

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:18.320
I still go all out once everyone has their eyes on me.

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:20.990
<i>This guy's even more of a big shot!</i>

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:23.700
He's right about that.

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:26.800
We got invited to one hell of a party.

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:28.530
Let's just go in there and have fun with it.

00:03:28.530 --> 00:03:30.200
Oh? Yeah!

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:32.440
I feel better already.

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:34.350
Glad to have you as our protégés.

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:37.540
How about we pay a visit to our dependable veteran?

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:40.050
I need to get in on his excitement.

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:46.050
So? What do you want?

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:49.260
We're all going to fight our battles.

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:53.060
We'll make sure to warm up the crowd for your second title run.

00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:56.510
I'm not sure exactly who you two are fighting,

00:03:56.510 --> 00:03:59.570
but be sure to stay true to your own brand of boxing.

00:03:59.570 --> 00:04:01.070
Right on!

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:04.810
He has a huge match coming up, but he's still concerned about them!

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:07.970
Thanks to him, they both look pumped.

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:10.790
There you are!

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:12.330
You two are up!

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:13.500
Hell yeah!

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:15.330
I'll be going first!

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:16.910
Good luck out there!

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:18.380
We're rooting for you!

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:19.210
Kick ass.

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:20.460
On it!

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:22.280
But if you don't win...

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:26.590
These are your new ‘dos, just like we promised.

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:35.480
I'm not feeling up to it. You go first.

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:38.690
Who are you to change the lineup?! Get the hell out there!

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:42.770
Make it a long one, so I can fully prep myself!

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:45.700
I'll crush him in an instant, so you won't get the chance!

00:04:46.690 --> 00:04:49.100
So all he did was put more pressure on them.

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:52.870
I thought he forgot those stupid bets!

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:59.330
Listen, Kimura, don't let the crowd get to you.

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:01.600
Keep it calm, keep it collected.

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:02.670
Yessir!

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:07.520
<i>That asshole reminded me of that goddamn bet.</i>

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:08.930
<i>I just have to win.</i>

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:10.550
Let's go, Kimura!

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:11.050
Yeah!

00:05:26.230 --> 00:05:28.700
Y-You're kidding me.

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:35.600
The capacity crowd of 15,000 is going wild before the match begins!

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:40.460
It's the Filipino Junior Lightweight Champion, Eleki Battery, versus Kimura Tatsuya!

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:44.640
<i>Everybody's eyes are on me?</i>

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:48.470
<i>How am I supposed to have fun with  </i>this?

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:49.750
Kimura!

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:52.470
Raise your fist to the fans!

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:53.720
Right...

00:05:58.240 --> 00:06:00.730
<i>That'll be my hairdo if I don't win?!</i>

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:02.730
<i>God, no. I don't want that!</i>

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:05.210
I'd say he has a case of the jitters.

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:07.740
H-He'll be fine once the bell rings.

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:11.050
<i>Kimura-san, good luck!</i>

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:18.970
<i>Should I size him up at the start? Or should I go in swinging?</i>

00:06:18.970 --> 00:06:20.600
<i>What to do? What to do?</i>

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:23.000
<i>You idiots! Don't ring the bell!</i>

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:25.250
<i>Hold on!</i>

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:27.550
<i>Let me think!</i>

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:29.760
Kimura-san, get away!

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:32.260
Get some space and find your rhythm!

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:33.890
<i>I'll speed up!</i>

00:06:33.890 --> 00:06:36.520
<i>I'll just shift to top gear and separate from him!</i>

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:40.530
He's fast!

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:42.400
He's matched Kimura-san's speed!

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:45.150
<i>Dammit, I forgot in all the excitement...</i>

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:47.820
<i>that he's the Filipino Champion!</i>

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:52.210
A solid counter! That had to hurt!

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:57.040
<i>I still haven't collected my thoughts!</i>

00:06:57.040 --> 00:06:58.810
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:01.620
Sensei! Kimura-san's...

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:04.010
Huh? What happened to Kimura?

00:07:04.010 --> 00:07:05.940
He's managing to stay in the fight...

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:10.680
...b-but he's doing it by clinching and running aimlessly around the ring!

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:12.970
<i>I think that  </i>was <i>his aim.</i>

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:18.240
But the fact Kimura's in a tough match means Eleki's that good.

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:20.770
Then that means I really have to watch out for Papaya.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.300
You'll be fine, Sensei.

00:07:23.300 --> 00:07:26.270
We've brought the mistress with us.

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:27.980
Tomiko!

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:29.230
Masaru!

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:35.590
It's like you read my mind!

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:37.490
This is just the pick-me-up I need!

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:42.220
Just calm down and fight with your distinctive flavor, Sensei!

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:43.750
<i>But even if he loses...</i>

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:45.300
<i>...this time around...</i>

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:47.880
<i>...it'll be totally sweet!</i>

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:54.380
A flagging Kimura's clinching once again!

00:07:54.380 --> 00:07:56.320
We're not here for a sumo match!

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:57.840
Punch it out like a man!

00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:59.390
Quit dancing around!

00:07:59.390 --> 00:08:02.600
<i>Dammit, it's now the seventh round.</i>

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:04.890
<i>He's even got the lead on points.</i>

00:08:04.890 --> 00:08:08.610
<i>In that case, I gotta lay it all on the line!</i>

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:12.960
A flurry of hits! Eleki's punching away!

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:15.160
And the hits just keep coming!

00:08:16.280 --> 00:08:17.950
<i>H-He's... good!</i>

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:21.950
<i>Aoki, I think I'm done for.</i>

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:24.040
<i>But...</i>

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:27.040
<i>You better fight hard.</i>

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:29.790
<i>Fight hard for Takamura-san.</i>

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:33.430
<i>I'm... counting on you!</i>

00:08:34.170 --> 00:08:37.240
What? He's about to lose?!

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:38.060
Stick a fork in him!

00:08:38.060 --> 00:08:39.260
He's done!

00:08:39.260 --> 00:08:42.180
<i>I see, so Kimura's...</i>

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:43.770
<i>If that's the case...</i>

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:49.530
If I lose, then we'll both have freaky hairdos! What a relief!

00:08:49.530 --> 00:08:51.690
<i>This keeps getting better!</i>

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:58.110
Whoa! He's down!

00:08:58.110 --> 00:09:02.370
After being driven to a corner, Kimura landed a desperate body shot!

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:04.120
He did it!

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:07.860
<i>Huh? That wasn't even much of a body blow.</i>

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:09.650
<i>But he still fell.</i>

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:14.260
<i>I get it! Body blows are his weakness!</i>

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:17.630
<i>And a huge weakness to boot!</i>

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:19.660
He's going to get up!

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:20.390
Yeah!

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:25.890
But now Kimura has gotten his composure back! He can win!

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:29.180
<i>That bastard hid behind his offensive prowess.</i>

00:09:29.180 --> 00:09:31.900
<i>But the secret's out, and you're getting nothing but body blows!</i>

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:38.680
How's the match going?

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:40.400
Did he lose?

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:41.660
Actually...

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:43.780
...he might just very well win!

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:46.950
Kimura's furiously attacking in the final round!

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:50.080
But time's quickly running out and we don't know who's leading!

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:54.250
How will it end? What will be the outcome of this match?!

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:05.330
Dammit! I was this close!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.090
Speak for yourself!

00:10:08.110 --> 00:10:10.690
You barely managed to get a draw.

00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:15.110
God, if only I knew he couldn't stand body blows...

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:15.940
Still,

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:18.850
that guy's definitely a national champion.

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:22.450
Be careful out there. I'm sure your opponent will be a real oddball.

00:10:23.270 --> 00:10:25.820
I'm sure I'll come out the bigger oddball than him!

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:27.340
Just watch.

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:33.290
<i>I'll just knock out a victory here and go home.</i>

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:35.300
<i>Say your prayers...</i>

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:36.800
<i>Papaya!</i>

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:42.590
{Stare...}

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:45.890
Now that's a surprise. He's not jittery at all.

00:10:46.320 --> 00:10:49.640
Wow, that's a relief. Aoki-san will win it for us!

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:52.470
Glad to see you're calm and focused.

00:10:52.470 --> 00:10:57.400
I was able to get my thoughts together thanks to Kimura's drawn-out fight.

00:10:57.400 --> 00:10:58.770
Really?

00:10:58.770 --> 00:11:00.560
That's good, so long as you have a gameplan.

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:03.180
But be sure to watch your opponent closely.

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:04.160
Got it!

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:06.610
<i>I had a good look at him.</i>

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:08.410
<i>I practically burned a hole through that picture.</i>

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:13.150
<i>What a dumbass!</i>

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:15.450
<i>They call them "glass chins" for a reason!</i>

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:18.210
<i>Yet, he's got a mole pasted on that spot!</i>

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:21.300
<i>I ain't gonna miss that huge bullseye!</i>

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:24.050
<i>That's exactly where I'm gonna Frog him!</i>

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:25.430
Get him!

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:26.970
<i>Gotcha!</i>

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:31.890
Oh! He's getting ready to pull a Frog! And just seconds after the bell?

00:11:31.890 --> 00:11:34.900
<i>His opponent's confused! This could work!</i>

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:38.900
<i>That bullseye will be as plain as day from below...</i>

00:11:41.290 --> 00:11:42.580
<i>Why?!</i>

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:44.160
<i>Where'd that mole go?!</i>

00:11:46.740 --> 00:11:48.180
Aoki holds back!

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:50.880
He didn't land a Frog, despite that perfect chance!

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:52.500
What's going on here?!

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:55.540
I thought he had him, why?

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:57.500
<i>What the hell?</i>

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:02.280
<i>The mole's gone north!</i>

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:07.030
<i>Was that a trap?!</i>

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:09.260
<i>How much of an oddball is he?!</i>

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:11.800
Now Aoki-san's confused?

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:14.060
What's going on in the ring?

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:17.090
I can smell it!

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:18.310
I can smell it too!

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:19.980
Wh-What smell?

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:22.680
That man named Papaya...

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:25.200
...has the same scent as Aoki-sensei!

00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:27.300
The same scent as Masaru?

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:32.830
What just happened? Aoki's now carefully maintaining his distance!

00:12:33.260 --> 00:12:36.300
<i>What now? There might be other traps.</i>

00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:41.300
<i>No, boxers who rely on bluffs and tricks probably aren't that good anyway.</i>

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:43.590
<i>I'll just take the direct approach!</i>

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:46.090
There goes Aoki!

00:12:48.180 --> 00:12:49.470
<i>I'm landing them!</i>

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:50.850
<i>I can do this!</i>

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:53.140
A Double Punch!

00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:54.480
And...

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:57.350
a powerful right hand!

00:13:02.570 --> 00:13:03.770
<i>Groggy, are we?</i>

00:13:03.770 --> 00:13:04.780
<i>You're mine!</i>

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:10.120
<i>Shit! He's just faking it!</i>

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:18.080
Aoki's face takes a full hit!

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:24.550
H-He's down!

00:13:24.550 --> 00:13:30.090
What a hit! Aoki did aerial 360°s! 
I've never seen a down quite like this!

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:32.140
Forget it. He's a goner.

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:33.600
That was too strong!

00:13:33.970 --> 00:13:35.600
Masaru!

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:38.350
Wh-What explosive power!

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:40.320
Was that the Coconut Punch?

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:41.650
Kimura-san?

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:43.860
I thought Yagi-san was only kidding.

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:44.860
One!

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:46.100
But I see this is no joke.

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:46.610
Two!

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:47.910
Aoki-san! Get up!

00:13:47.730 --> 00:13:48.730
Three!

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:49.820
How could anyone get up from that?

00:13:49.820 --> 00:13:50.820
Four!

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:52.300
Ah! His legs!

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:52.890
Five!

00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:53.670
You got guts!

00:13:53.670 --> 00:13:54.620
You can do it!

00:13:53.710 --> 00:13:54.620
Six!

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:56.620
Whoa! He's actually up!

00:13:56.960 --> 00:13:58.810
Let him fight, Ref!

00:13:57.920 --> 00:14:00.610
But it appears he took a lot of damage!

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:00.940
{overlap}The first round just started!

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:02.920
Will he be able to continue the match?

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:02.920
{overlap}You better keep it going!

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:05.050
C-Can you fight?

00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:07.420
Box!

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:09.130
The fight resumes!

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:13.300
Papaya attacks, and Aoki's at wit's end!

00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:15.720
He's now just a human sandbag!

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:17.380
H-He's tough.

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:19.560
His punches are out of this world!

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:22.520
If he keeps taking them, he'll be in real trouble!

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:26.440
<i>I'm starting to feel good.</i>

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:29.450
<i>So... what am I doing now?</i>

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:32.450
<i>Wh... Who's that?</i>

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:35.200
<i>And what's with the hairdo?</i>

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:38.960
<i>If you don't win, this is your new hairdo!</i>

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:42.780
<i>Oh... now I remember.</i>

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:46.000
<i>So I'm getting that hairdo?</i>

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:50.760
Masaru!

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:54.760
<i>Will it look spiffy?</i>

00:14:55.350 --> 00:14:58.520
<i>Hell no, it won't!</i>

00:14:59.090 --> 00:15:01.480
He just barely dodges it!

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:02.760
Slip!

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:04.410
That last juke caused him to fall!

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:06.480
His body is too damaged to hold him up!

00:15:06.820 --> 00:15:08.700
He must have really felt those.

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:13.240
That may be true, but that SOB Aoki's regained his consciousness.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.760
Look, he's taking his sweet time standing up.

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:16.300
Get up!

00:15:16.300 --> 00:15:19.200
He's stalling so that he can recover.

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:21.600
<i>That dick!</i>

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:26.280
<i>I'd never be able to walk the town with Tomiko with that hairdo!</i>

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:30.010
<i>But what do I do about that explosive punch?</i>

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:34.180
<i>I gotta find Papaya's weak spot and soon!</i>

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:35.110
Box!

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:37.620
Papaya staggers!

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:38.970
Did that hurt him?

00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:41.480
<i>Playing possum again?!</i>

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:47.590
<i>What's with that right hand? It really feels like I'm being hit with a coconut!</i>

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:49.920
That's the bell!

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:55.530
Aoki managed to survive the first round and Papaya's overwhelming offensive!

00:15:59.650 --> 00:16:02.160
You all right, Aoki? Take deep breaths!

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:05.170
<i>M-My legs are still numb.</i>

00:16:05.740 --> 00:16:09.670
<i>If I take another Coconut Punch, I'm out.</i>

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:15.640
<i>I can't find... a goddamn... weakness!</i>

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:19.180
<i>In that case, I'll have to take that risk...</i>

00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:21.930
<i>and stake the whole match on this move!</i>

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:34.280
<i>Th-That's...</i>

00:16:36.530 --> 00:16:38.280
<i>There it is! His Look-Away!</i>

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:53.310
You morons! Why are you both trying the Look-Away?!

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:54.110
What the hell are you doing?!

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:55.470
Is this some kind of bit?!

00:16:55.470 --> 00:16:58.510
<i>This guy can do the Look-Away?!</i>

00:16:58.510 --> 00:16:59.680
Two oddballs...

00:16:59.680 --> 00:17:01.510
...playing off each other!

00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:04.760
<i>I would have looked with him if I didn't look the other way!</i>

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:06.940
<i>What a fearsome move!</i>

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:08.490
<i>Don't think about that!</i>

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:10.730
<i>I need to find his weakness!</i>

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:12.320
We got clinching in this match too?

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:14.440
We're not here to see sumo wrestling!

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:16.490
I've had it with these matches!

00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:18.020
Aoki, you have to hit him!

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:20.240
Running from him won't get you anywhere!

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:23.200
<i>Easy for him to say!</i>

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:27.250
<i>There's no way I can trade those punches!</i>

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:30.880
<i>Doesn't he have a damn weakness? Doesn't he?!</i>

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:41.140
<i>Wh... What's that?</i>

00:17:42.350 --> 00:17:44.350
<i>That's a whole lotta sweat.</i>

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:48.880
<i>This is the fourth round — just ten minutes of fighting.</i>

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:50.520
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:53.520
<i>Maybe he's...</i>

00:17:58.060 --> 00:18:01.370
<i>I'll hold my breath and duke it out!</i>

00:18:13.890 --> 00:18:16.740
Papaya's losing steam really fast.

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:17.730
Why?

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:19.820
Wait! Now I get it!

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:25.470
The reason why he played possum, did the Look-Away, and tried to land those Coconut Punches...

00:18:25.470 --> 00:18:28.810
is because he wants to end the fight quick!

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:38.690
<i>I knew it! His weakness is...</i>

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:41.860
<i>his lack of stamina!</i>

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:44.080
<i>Now that I know that...</i>

00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:49.500
Whoa! Aoki's rallying back!

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:51.620
Is Papaya out of energy?!

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:53.250
He looks like he's about to fall!

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:54.500
Masaru!

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:56.290
Put him down!

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:58.300
Go get him, Aoki-san!

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:09.810
Only a few seconds left in the final round!

00:19:09.810 --> 00:19:12.190
Aoki's been going after a weakened Papaya!

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:15.230
And now he's tired, too!

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:19.030
What're you doing, Aoki?!

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:20.610
You're giving us another slogfest?!

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:22.630
The guy's barely standing!

00:19:22.630 --> 00:19:25.660
This motherslogging slogfest!

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:28.410
I can't tell if they're punching or hugging each other!

00:19:31.840 --> 00:19:33.660
And it ends in a slogging mess!

00:19:33.660 --> 00:19:35.950
So it's just another Aoki fight!

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:37.290
You both lose!

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:38.420
I want my money back!

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:42.090
It's over.

00:19:42.090 --> 00:19:43.900
It ended in another draw.

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:48.160
I think the spectators have had enough of those.

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:51.100
Why don't you go in and liven up the crowd for Takamura.

00:19:51.400 --> 00:19:54.870
Forgive me, but they are none of my concern.

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:57.360
All I'm concerned about...

00:20:00.790 --> 00:20:02.610
is winning my match.

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:04.100
And mine alone.
